engine/godot/issues/119188","id":4374303139,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBLqRow","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-04T20:37:15Z","updated_at":"2026-05-04T20:37:15Z","body":"> Still failing with other dependency related errors from plugin.\n\nFor the reference, other errors were caused by `bareRepository = explicit` in the `.gitconfig` (which seems to be default). With it temporary disabled, it is still failing (producing about 20K lines of swift and duplicate symbol related messages).\n\nI still was not able to reproduce the crash with multiple exports.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4374303139/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4376612553","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119188#issuecomment-4376612553","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119188","id":4376612553,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBN3OyQ","user":{"login":"cengiz-pz","id":112892340,"node_id":"U_kgDOBrqZtA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112892340?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz","html_url":"https://github.com/cengiz-pz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-05T04:51:00Z","updated_at":"2026-05-05T04:52:34Z","body":"I executed the editor under `lldb` after applying ad-hoc code signing with the required entitlements:\n\n```zsh\n% codesign -s - --deep --force --options=runtime --entitlements /Volumes/Code/Godot/misc/editor.entitlements /Applications/Godot-4.7-beta1.app \n% lldb -- /Applications/Godot-4.7-beta1.app/Contents/MacOS/Godot --editor --path /Volumes/Code/Godot/plugin/godot-firebase/demo\n```\n\nWithin `lldb`, the target was configured and launched as follows:\n\n```lldb\n(lldb) target create \"/Applications/Godot-4.7-beta1.app/Contents/MacOS/Godot\"\nCurrent executable set to '/Applications/Godot-4.7-beta1.app/Contents/MacOS/Godot' (arm64).\n(lldb) settings set -- target.run-args  \"--editor\" \"--path\" \"/Volumes/Code/Godot/plugin/godot-firebase/demo\"\n(lldb) run\n```\n\nThe process started successfully, but subsequently terminated with a crash. The `lldb` output at the time of failure is shown below:\n\n```text\nProcess 25872 launched: '/Applications/Godot-4.7-beta1.app/Contents/MacOS/Godot' (arm64)\n\n...\n\nSymLink /Users/cengiz-pz/Library/Developer/Xcode/DerivedData/Firebase_Demo-bvnxaimrsxzyscggtbgpbeoqrbil/Build/Intermediates.noindex/ArchiveIntermediates/Firebase\\ Demo/BuildProductsPath/Debug-iphoneos/GoogleUtilities-Reachability.o ../../IntermediateBuildFilesPath/UninstalledProducts/iphoneos/GoogleUtilities-Reachability.o (in target 'GoogleUtilities-Reachability' from project 'GoogleUtilities')\n    cd /Users/cengiz-pz/Library/Developer/Xcode/DerivedData/Firebase_Demo-bvnxaimrsxzyscggtbgpbeoqrbil/SourcePackages/checkouts/GoogleUtilities\n\nProcess 25872 stopped\n* thread #1, queue = 'com.apple.main-thread', stop reason = EXC_BAD_ACCESS (code=1, address=0x18)\n    frame #0: 0x00000001031b93d0 Godot`___lldb_unnamed_symbol161861 + 804\nGodot`___lldb_unnamed_symbol161861:\n->  0x1031b93d0 <+804>: ldr    x26, [x0, #0x18]\n    0x1031b93d4 <+808>: ldr    x8, [x26]\n    0x1031b93d8 <+812>: cmp    x8, x0\n    0x1031b93dc <+816>: b.ne   0x1031b93e8    ; <+828>\nTarget 0: (Godot) stopped.\n```\n\nThe crash is an `EXC_BAD_ACCESS` at address `0x18`, indicating a likely null or invalid pointer dereference.\n\nNotably, preceding output shows `xcodebuild` activity, suggesting that the failure occurs after the export step, during the iOS build pipeline invocation.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4376612553/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4378114217","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119188#issuecomment-4378114217","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119188","id":4378114217,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBPS4qQ","user":{"login":"cengiz-p