2892340?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz","html_url":"https://github.com/cengiz-pz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-11T15:47:39Z","updated_at":"2026-05-11T15:47:39Z","body":"@akien-mga, I am highly confident this is not a regression introduced in 4.7, but rather a pre-existing issue that has likely remained latent for some time. It has been exposed by a faulty plugin that generated tens of thousands of linker errors at export time, exceeding what the UI error-reporting pipeline can reliably process. Unfortunately, I’m unable to reproduce the identical conditions on 4.6, as the plugin neither supports nor compiles against that Godot version. Based on the current evidence, I do not consider this issue a release-blocking concern for 4.7.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4422296746/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4422387694","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119188#issuecomment-4422387694","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godo